WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.420
You said it was too expensive

00:00:01.421 --> 00:00:03.781
so we dropped the price. You still said it was too much

00:00:03.782 --> 00:00:05.341
so we threw in free shipping.

00:00:05.342 --> 00:00:06.541
Still think it's pricey?

00:00:06.542 --> 00:00:09.521
We just upgraded you to the brand new Pro version.

00:00:09.522 --> 00:00:11.261
This is the most powerful fan I've ever used.

00:00:11.262 --> 00:00:12.861
Up to like 9 miles an hour.

00:00:12.862 --> 00:00:14.821
Its neck worn design freeze up your hands

00:00:14.822 --> 00:00:17.201
and it folds down to be compact and portable.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.780
If that sounds familiar, she's definitely not the cheapest,

00:00:19.781 --> 00:00:21.641
but she is worth every penny.
